sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: ADR 0244 task + single-swamp-node; DECISIONS R1 (record-only: no run), R3 (server key by name), refuse with no server, always-run cleanup.
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as DB server Node<br/>reached over ssh
  CLI->>GW: database:update<br/>{connection: cache, database: 3}
  Note over GW: Validate, seal the patch<br/>no server → server_required
  opt record-only change
    Note over GW: Write the row, no run<br/>R1 · broadcast DatabaseUpdated
    GW-->>CLI: 200 Updated<br/>no task
  end
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>…-database-connection-update
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>task #5122
  SW->>N: Copy action scripts<br/>@swamp/ssh · swamp role identity
  SW->>N: Check index fits server<br/>vault.get server key by name
  Note over SW: Remove /tmp scripts<br/>always-run step, pass or fail
  alt index check passes
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded<br/>terminal event + outputs
    Note over GW: Apply sealed patch<br/>broadcast DatabaseUpdated
  else index check fails
    N--xSW: exit 1, step output
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>database.server_command_failed
    Note over GW: Connection unchanged<br/>task failed
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #5122
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
